</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:11.55em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="162.51" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 159.82)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.F4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A1.F4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Claim]<span id="A1.F4.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">The net interest expense in 2023, considering debt interest and capitalized interest, was $183,479,000.

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"></span>[Supporting Evidence (Context Index)]
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.F4.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">107

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"></span>[Explanation of Reasoning Process]
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.F4.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">1. From table 107, the debt interest paid in 2023 is given as $183,479,000 and the capitalized interest amount is $-2,483,000).
<br class="ltx_break">2. We can calculate the net interest expense as 183479 - 2483 = 180996.
<br class="ltx_break">3. Therefore, the statement is refuted.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>An example within <span id="A1.F4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FinDVer</span> <em id="A1.F4.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">testmini</em> set
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.F5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="311.84" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 311.84" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,311.84) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 305.93 C 0 309.19 2.64 311.84 5.91 311.84 L 647.24 311.84 C 650.51 311.84 653.15 309.19 653.15 305.93 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7F7;" fill="#F7F7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 287.72 L 651.18 287.72 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 296.32)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
